     "claim": "K_hook",
     "type": "established",
     "claim_text": "The Colombian Navy seized an uncrewed (unmanned), remote-controlled semi-submersible fitted with a Starlink satellite antenna off Colombia's Caribbean coast, near Santa Marta / Tayrona National Park; it was announced on 2 July 2025 as the first such drone narco sub found in South American waters. A navy spokeswoman confirmed to AFP that the antenna was Starlink's; the navy said the link let traffickers operate it remotely. Narration: 'Smugglers built a drone sub run by Starlink.' Headline 'A DRONE SUBMARINE / RUN BY STARLINK'. Label 'COLOMBIA'S CARIBBEAN COAST · 2025'; the antenna callout says 'a commercial terminal, as reported'.",
